  // debug plotter in the same file, DOES land (stack_structures.jsonc, a
  // plain four-vector array).
  // (method 224 wvehicle): the same offset-720-on-self class as (method 62
  // wvehicle) above ("Could not figure out load: (set! f1 (l.f (+ a0
  // 720)))"); its declared signature is fixed in this same commit (float
  // float -> float, proven by all three of its own callers), only the body
