  // bodies transcribe clean with zero warnings under stack_structures.jsonc
  // entries pointing sp+16 at the two new types (mirrored in
  // decompiler/config/jakx/all-types.gc); no type_casts.jsonc entries were
  // needed for either.
  // (method 133 wvehicle): arg1 (a type_casts.jsonc cast, not a signature
  // change, since it is declared on vehicle) reads clean as rigid-body-
  // vehicle-constants at offsets 0/12/212/224/228/240/244/264/268/312/316
  // (all float, matching that type's own nested rigid-body-info and
  // vehicle-transmission-info/vehicle-handling-info fields), but its very
