  // that fixes every other read breaks this one.
  // (method 157 wvehicle): decodes clean on its own but calls
  // meters-per-sec->mph, whose real signature this rung can prove (float
  // float, the jak3 twin plus this method's own call site) but whose
  // implementation is not defined anywhere in the jakx corpus; activating
