  // symbol that is not landed links as zero), so held alongside its own
  // only unresolved callee rather than landed on a zero-linking call.
  // (method 64 wvehicle), wvehicle-weapons-vein rung 6: the "s5+312" note
  // above is stale. type_casts.jsonc's own s5 cast (winit rung, extended
  // rung 5) plus gunmount-drawable-init-by-other's own landing (rung 6)
