    // first attack-info's own copy at op 212, which resolves fine) hard-
    // regresses dozens of unrelated stores elsewhere in the function the
    // moment ANY cast (tried v1 and s2, tried (pointer uint128) and
    // vector) touches that op, independent of which register or type;
    // isolated by adding and removing one cast at a time. Same
    // asm-plus-named-extern shape as water-anim-event-handler
    // (goal_src/jakx/engine/common-obs/water-anim.gc), not the anonymous
    // asm_functions_by_name treatment above, because a defstate's :event
    // slot cannot hold a raw label the way a free function's decompile
    // fallback can: see explosion-explode-event-handler below.
    "(anon-function 3 explosion)",
